For the purposes of this Licence:

1. "Source" means the form of the Hardware preferred for making
   modifications, including all components, modules, sub-assemblies,
   design files, schematics, and layout data, together with any
   accompanying documentation.

2. "Product" means any physical object made on the basis of the Source
   or a Modified Version.

3. "Modified Version" means any Source created by modifying or
   supplementing the Source, or by creating a new design that
   reproduces all or a substantial part of the original elements of
   the Source.

4. "Licensor" means the individual or entity that grants this Licence.

5. "You" means the individual or entity exercising rights under this
   Licence.

6. "Distribution" means any act of providing access to a copy of the
   Source or a Modified Version to any third party, including any
   physical transfer of a Product to a third party where the Product
   is accompanied by, or made available together with, the Source or
   a Modified Version.

Conditions
----------

1. **Copyleft/Share-Alike.** If You Distribute Modified Versions of
   the Source, or Products made from Modified Versions, You must make
   the Source of those Modified Versions available under this same
   version of this Licence (or, at Your option, any later version).

2. **Attribution.** If You Distribute the Source, Modified Versions,
   or Products, You must retain or provide:
   a. the same copyright or similar proprietary notices that the
      Source contains;
   b. a notice that the Source is licensed under the CERN-OHL-S v2;
   c. a copy or reference to the full text of this Licence; and
   d. if You Distribute Modified Versions, a notice stating that You
      have modified the Source.

3. **Availability of Source.** If You Distribute a Product, You must
   make the corresponding Source available to anyone who receives the
   Product, in a reasonably accepted manner in the relevant field,
   and You must inform the recipients where they can obtain the
   Source.

4. **Web-based Distribution.** If You make the Source or Modified
   Versions available for download through a network or similar
   facility, You must also make the corresponding source code
   available in the same way through the same facility.

5. **No additional restrictions.** You may not impose any further
   restrictions on the exercise of the rights granted under this
   Licence beyond what this Licence provides.

6. **Patent grant.** The Licensor grants You a licence under any
   patent rights the Licensor holds or has the right to grant, to
   the extent necessary to exercise the rights granted under this
   Licence.

